    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69886" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναύ-σταθμον</span></b> , τό,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>harbour, anchorage, roadstead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
