				3.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				602
			</span></i> (pl.):—more freq. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναύ-σταθμος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
