				5.19.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				27.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Nic.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, etc.; hence of <i>ships assembled in a roadstead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Arist.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
